menu "lockdrv (HSJ08H lock actuator driver)"

    config LOCKDRV_PULSE_MS
        int "Actuator pulse width (ms)"
        default 235
        help
            OEM parity: 235-240 ms measured on the scope for open, close AND
            the boot home pulse (all the same width, single parameter).
            See HANDOFF_Solenoid_HSJ08H.md, sections 10-13.

    config LOCKDRV_GUARD_MS
        int "No-retrigger guard window after a pulse (ms)"
        default 100
        help
            Protection added by us (no OEM equivalent needed: the OEM never
            re-triggers within a cycle). Rejects any new pulse request while
            active. 0 disables the guard window.

    config LOCKDRV_HOME_ON_INIT
        bool "Retract pulse at boot (OEM parity)"
        default y
        help
            The OEM pulses INB (retract) at power-up so the open-loop
            actuator always starts from the known rest position.

    config LOCKDRV_HOME_DELAY_MS
        int "Delay before the boot retract pulse (ms)"
        default 500
        depends on LOCKDRV_HOME_ON_INIT
        help
            NOT measured on the OEM (the power-up capture showed the pulse
            but not the delay from power-on). The pulse itself is OEM-proven;
            adjust this delay when the OEM boot timing is captured.

endmenu
